Scenario: View Changelog Single Page Search Result Details
	Changelog details on a single page should work properly

	Given I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product from "Fix Pack 75" to "Fix Pack 76"
	And I go to the Changelog tab
	And I click on the changelog entry with the content "Error Message after the session expires is not translated"
	Then the changelog entry details with the content "Error Message after the session expires is not translated" should be visible
	When I close the changelog details window
	And I click on the changelog entry with the content "Merge Public Pages results in wrong Navigation Menu"
	Then the changelog entry details with the content "Merge Public Pages results in wrong Navigation Menu" should be visible
	When I close the changelog details window
	And I click on the changelog entry with the content "Can not create a Data Provider if the default language is set to Spanish"
	Then the changelog entry details with the content "Can not create a Data Provider if the default language is set to Spanish" should be visible
	When I close the changelog details window
	And I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product from "Fix Pack 51" to "Fix Pack 52"
	And I click on the changelog entry with the content "Create a new remote UserService method to retrieve paginated users that are members of a user group"
	Then the changelog entry details with the content "Create a new remote UserService method to retrieve paginated users that are members of a user group" should be visible
	When I close the changelog details window
	And I click on the changelog entry with the content "Weekday abbreviations in the recurrence dialog are not localized"
	Then the changelog entry details with the content "Weekday abbreviations in the recurrence dialog are not localized" should be visible
	When I close the changelog details window
	And I click on the changelog entry with the content "Predefined value for select from list form field will not stay"
	Then the changelog entry details with the content "Predefined value for select from list form field will not stay" should be visible

Scenario: View Changelog Single Page Search Results
	Changelog search filtering on a single page should work properly

	Given I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product from "Fix Pack 75" to "Fix Pack 76"
	And I go to the Changelog tab
	Then the results count should say that there are "43" results
